\",\"number\":3,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T10:50:59Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"failure\",\"name\":\"Gate (shard 1/4)\",\"number\":4,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:43:47Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:01Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Post Set up Chez, Gambit and the certify oracle\",\"number\":7,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:00Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:01Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Post Run actions/checkout@v5\",\"number\":8,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:01Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:01Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Complete job\",\"number\":9,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:01Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"}],\"url\":\"https://github.com/sonwh98/jolt/actions/runs/44509339647/job/135509348524\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:24Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"databaseId\":135509348568,\"name\":\"test (2/4)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T10:50:45Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T10:50:46Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Set up job\",\"number\":1,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T10:50:46Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T10:50:57Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run actions/checkout@v5\",\"number\":2,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T10:50:46Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T10:56:26Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Set up Chez, Gambit and the certify oracle\",\"number\":3,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T10:50:57Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:22Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Gate (shard 2/4)\",\"number\":4,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T10:56:26Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:22Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Post Set up Chez, Gambit and the certify oracle\",\"number\":7,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:22Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:22Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Post Run actions/checkout@v5\",\"number\":8,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:22Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:22Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Complete job\",\"number\":9,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:22Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"}],\"url\":\"https://github.com/sonwh98/jolt/actions/runs/44509339647/job/135509348568\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:50Z\",\"conclusion\":\"failure\",\"databaseId\":135516607068,\"name\":\"Android (bionic)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:45Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:45Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Set up job\",\"number\":1,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:45Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:48Z\",\"conclusion\":\"failure\",\"name\":\"Run test \\\"failure\\\" = success\",\"number\":2,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:46Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:48Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Complete job\",\"number\":3,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:04:48Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"}],\"url\":\"https://github.com/sonwh98/jolt/actions/runs/44509339647/job/135516607068\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:08Z\",\"conclusion\":\"failure\",\"databaseId\":135536998484,\"name\":\"test\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:05Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:06Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Set up job\",\"number\":1,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:06Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:06Z\",\"conclusion\":\"failure\",\"name\":\"Run test \\\"failure\\\" = success\",\"number\":2,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:06Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:06Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Complete job\",\"number\":3,\"startedAt\":\"2026-11-19T11:44:06Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"}],\"url\":\"https://github.com/sonwh98/jolt/actions/runs/44509339647/job/135536998484\"}],\"url\":\"https://github.com/sonwh98/jolt/actions/runs/44509339647\"}\n# Gambit native FFI: stage 1 (partial)\n\nThis tier implements native memory, scoped loading, registered ordinary calls,\ninvocation-local errno capture, and real `##gc`. It is qualified here only on\n**macOS arm64, the provisioned single-threaded Gambit 4.9.8**. P2/P3 consumers\nremain Chez-only. It does not provide GC-safe blocking or callbacks.\n\nRun from the checkout root:\n\n```sh\nGAMBIT_PREFIX=/Users/sto/.local/share/mise/installs/gambit/4.9.8\nmake gambitffi gambitcheck gambitkernel gambiteval GAMBIT_PREFIX=\"$GAMBIT_PREFIX\"\nmake gambitseedcheck CHEZ=/Users/sto/.local/share/mise/installs/chezscheme/10.4.1/bin/scheme\n```\n\nAll new FFI gates fail if their toolchain or bridge is absent. `gambitcheck`\nrequires the bridge and runs both its adapter checks and the public-source\nwitness. The ABI target also runs that public witness. Every native artifact\nis rebuilt on each make invocation, after input and toolchain digest checks.\nA timed-out gate kills its process group and returns 124.\n\n## Build and ABI identity\n\n`shapes.json` is the reviewed stage-1 projection of the 44-shape inventory\n`p1b-inv/shim-registry.edn` at fork `a6852ef8`. It includes ordinary procedure\nshapes S01/S01b/S02/S03/S12/S12b/S13/S18/S19/S20/S21/S22/S22b/S22c/S23/\nS26/S26b/S26c/S26d/S26e, the S32 declared-tail fixture (two fixed arguments),\nand thirteen explicit scalar identity fixtures. S19 and S20 share one ABI.\nBlocking/callable/pointer-call/aggregate/bare-varargs shapes are refused.\nOther shapes are deliberately rejected; this is not unrestricted FFI.\n\n`generate-shims.py` emits `generated-shims.scm` from that manifest. Identity\nincludes argument types, result type, capture mode, and **variadic boundary**.\nFixed `(int,int,int)` and variadic `(int,int,...)` must use different C types\non Apple arm64. Chez `integer-32` tokens map to Gambit `int32` conversions.\nPointers cross as exact integers; static assertions require LP64.\n\nAfter an intentional input change:\n\n```sh\npython3 host/gambit/ffi/generate-shims.py\nsh host/gambit/ffi/make-digests.sh\n```\n\n`DIGESTS.txt` pins source/generated inputs, the provenance helper scripts, and\nevery platform manifest in deterministic C-locale filename order.\n# ---- P1b-stage1: the gambitffi* gates ----------------------------------------\n#\n# The bounded FFI tier qualified per the standing codex C4 PARTIAL-GO ruling:\n# memory ops, loading, ordinary calls and invocation-local errno capture,\n# behind the ahead-of-time native bridge (host/gambit/ffi/joltffi-bridge.scm,\n# compiled by gsc into build/gambit-ffi/joltffi-bridge.o1). Blocking,\n# callables, runtime signatures and object pinning keep their message-carrying\n# refusals; the gates assert both the witnesses AND the retained refusals.\n#\n# Deterministic bootstrap: every artifact builds from the pinned inputs in\n# host/gambit/ffi/DIGESTS.txt — verified before compiling, output digests\n# recorded after. No ambient .o1/.dylib is ever trusted. The aggregate target\n# is fail-closed: it passes only when all three gate scripts pass, and a gate\n# runs under the P1a-r2 external watchdog (host/gambit/ffi/watchdog.sh, the\n# same pattern the p1a witnesses use) so a frozen VM is a recorded failure,\n# never a hang.\n\nGAMBIT-FFI-DIR := host/gambit/ffi\nGAMBIT-FFI-BUILD := build/gambit-ffi\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
